|-
|{{ill|Nojikubo Kofun|ja|野地久保古墳|qq=draft|qq=draft}}||{{ill|Joenkahofun|ja|上円下方墳|lt=Joenkahofun|qq=draft|qq=draft}}||Cave Tomb-style stone chamber||Late 7th to early 8th century
