'''Shimofusazuka Kofun''' (下総塚古墳) is a [[:en:Kofun|Kofun]] located in [[:en:Shirakawa, Fukushima|Shirakawa, Fukushima]] Funada (舟田), Fukushima Prefecture. It is a [[:en:Zenpokoenfun|Zenpokoenfun]] Historic Site1 as a National Historic Site (part of the [[:en:Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites|Shirakawa Funada-Motonuma Sites]]).

== Overview ==

